diff --git a/CHANGES.rst b/CHANGES.rst
index a39471f..4d2cc64 100644
--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -17,6 +17,10 @@ Unreleased
 -   ``echo_via_pager`` flushes after each write, so passing a generator streams
     output to the pager incrementally instead of staying hidden until the pipe
     buffer fills. :issue:`3242` :issue:`2542` :pr:`3534`
+-   ``echo_via_pager`` no longer closes ``stdout`` when the configured pager
+    command is empty or cannot be found, which caused
+    ``ValueError: I/O operation on closed file`` in later output, such as in
+    ``CliRunner.invoke``.
 
 
 Version 8.4.1
